---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';

const personSchema = {
  '@type': 'Person',
  name: 'Sanjeev',
  jobTitle: 'Founder & Senior Marketing Strategist',
  worksFor: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Happyranks' },
  url: 'https://happyranks.com/about',
  sameAs: ['https://www.linkedin.com/in/sanjeev/'],
  knowsAbout: ['Marketing Strategy', 'SEO', 'Generative Engine Optimization', 'Marketing Automation'],
};
---

<Layout
  title="About — Senior marketing, without the agency overhead"
  description="Happyranks is led by Sanjeev, a senior marketing operator with 12+ years building marketing systems for businesses across the US, UK, UAE, and India."
  active="/about"
  schema={personSchema}
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero-section relative">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow mb-3">About Happyranks</div>
          <h1 class="text-display-1 text-fg mb-6">
            Senior marketing execution,<br/>
            <span class="text-gradient-brand">without the agency overhead</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg text-fg-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-2xl">
            Happyranks was built around a simple observation: most businesses don't need another
            agency. They need a senior marketing operator who can build the system, ship the work,
            and show them the numbers.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-fg-muted leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl">
            We work with a small, focused client roster — 8-12 active engagements at any time.
            The person scoping your audit is the person building your system. No account managers.
            No junior handoffs. The PULSE framework is the lens for every engagement.
          </p>
          <a href="/pulse-audit" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">
            <i class="ph-bold ph-lightning"></i>
            Get my free PULSE audit
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 lg:sticky lg:top-24">
          <div class="aspect-square rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-canvas-2 to-canvas border border-border flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <div class="w-32 h-32 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--color-brand)] to-[#7a0a0a] flex items-center justify-center text-6xl font-black text-fg">S</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="text-xl font-bold text-fg">Sanjeev</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-fg-muted mono">Founder · Senior Strategist</div>
            <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-border grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-center">
              <div>
                <div class="text-2xl font-black text-fg">12+</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] mono text-fg-muted uppercase">years</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-2xl font-black text-fg">80+</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] mono text-fg-muted uppercase">clients</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-2xl font-black text-fg">4</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] mono text-fg-muted uppercase">continents</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOUNDER STORY -->
  <section class="section-y">
    <div class="container-wide max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow mb-4">Founder story</div>
      <h2 class="text-display-2 text-fg mb-12">
        Why Happyranks exists
      </h2>
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-fg">
          The agency model is broken for most businesses. You pay retainer fees, get assigned
          a junior team, and wait 90 days to find out whether anything actually worked.
        </p>
        <p class="text-fg-secondary">
          I built Happyranks because I kept watching smart business owners get sold tactics
          they didn\'t need, and miss the foundational work they did. They were spending $8K/month
          on Google Ads with no conversion tracking. They were running Facebook campaigns with
          no pixel installed. They were launching lead magnets with no email follow-up.
        </p>
        <p class="text-fg-secondary">
          The pattern was always the same: the marketing looked busy, but the business wasn\'t
          growing. Nobody was measuring the right things.
        </p>
        <p class="text-fg font-semibold">
          The PULSE framework was the answer. Score the system, find the leaks, fix them in
          order. No theory, no fluff — just the work that moves numbers.
        </p>
        <p class="text-fg-secondary">
          We\'re based in Coimbatore, India, and work with clients across the US, UK, UAE, and
          India. The timezone difference is real, but it\'s also an advantage — your site is
          being worked on while you sleep, and you\'ve got fresh insights in your inbox every
          morning.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- VALUES / MANIFESTO -->
  <section class="section-y bg-bg-subtle">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">How we work</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-2 text-fg mb-6">
          Four things<br/>
          <span class="text-gradient-brand">we don't compromise on</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        {[
          {
            n: '01',
            title: 'Measure first, build second',
            desc: 'Every engagement starts with a PULSE audit. We don\'t ship work we can\'t measure. You always know what we did and whether it worked.',
            icon: 'ph-chart-line-up',
          },
          {
            n: '02',
            title: 'Senior execution, no handoffs',
            desc: 'The person scoping your work is the person doing the work. No account managers, no junior handoffs, no re-learning your business three times.',
            icon: 'ph-user-circle',
          },
          {
            n: '03',
            title: 'Transparent pricing, real numbers',
            desc: 'Three tiers, published prices, no surprise invoices. You see the quote before we start. We share real metrics, not vanity metrics.',
            icon: 'ph-receipt',
          },
          {
            n: '04',
            title: 'Small roster, deep work',
            desc: 'We cap active engagements at 12. That means more focus, faster shipping, and the senior attention your business actually deserves.',
            icon: 'ph-stack',
          },
        ].map((v) => (
          <div class="card p-8">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-bg-muted border border-border flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-brand)]">
                <i class={`ph-bold ${v.icon} text-2xl`}></i>
              </div>
              <div class="text-3xl font-black text-ink-4 mono">{v.n}</div>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-fg mb-3">{v.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-fg-secondary leading-relaxed">{v.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
  <section class="section-y">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">What clients say</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-2 text-fg mb-6">
          Senior execution<br/>
          <span class="text-gradient-light">in their words</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        {[
          { quote: 'Working with Happyranks felt less like hiring an agency and more like adding a senior marketing leader to our team. They measure everything, ship fast, and the numbers show.', name: 'Mae Guzman', role: 'Head of Growth, Efficy' },
          { quote: 'Before Happyranks, I was chasing couples on Instagram. Now they book a visit themselves, show up ready to sign, and the reviews keep building.', name: 'Karthik Raman', role: 'Owner, Lotus Mahal' },
          { quote: 'We\'re now the firm that ChatGPT recommends. Our competitors are still figuring out what GEO means. The maturity model we built with Happyranks has become our calling card.', name: 'James Thornton', role: 'MD, Think Accounting' },
        ].map((t) => (
          <div class="card p-6">
            <i class="ph-fill ph-quotes text-[var(--color-brand)] text-3xl mb-4"></i>
            <p class="text-fg leading-relaxed mb-6">{t.quote}</p>
            <div class="border-t border-border pt-4">
              <div class="font-bold text-fg text-sm">{t.name}</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-fg-muted">{t.role}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TECH STACK -->
  <section class="section-y bg-bg-subtle">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">The stack</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-3 text-fg">
          Tools we'd <span class="text-gradient-brand">actually recommend</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base text-fg-muted mt-4">
          We use the same tools on our own business that we recommend to clients. Here\'s the
          full stack, broken down by category.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        {[
          { c: 'Analytics', items: ['GA4', 'Looker Studio', 'Microsoft Clarity', 'Hotjar', 'Mixpanel'] },
          { c: 'SEO / GEO', items: ['Ahrefs', 'Semrush', 'Screaming Frog', 'Perplexity tracking', 'Custom AI-overview monitor'] },
          { c: 'Automation', items: ['Mautic', 'HubSpot', 'Make.com', 'n8n', 'ActiveCampaign'] },
          { c: 'Conversion', items: ['Calendly', 'Cal.com', 'Stripe', 'Typeform', 'Whisper Surveys'] },
          { c: 'Design', items: ['Figma', 'Framer', 'Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Phosphor Icons'] },
          { c: 'Email', items: ['AWS SES', 'Mautic', 'Mailgun', 'Postmark', 'Sendgrid'] },
        ].map((s) => (
          <div class="card p-6">
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-fg mb-3 mono uppercase tracking-widest">{s.c}</div>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              {s.items.map((i) => (
                <li class="text-sm text-fg-muted flex items-center gap-2">
                  <i class="ph-bold ph-dot text-[var(--color-brand)]"></i>
                  {i}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- LOCATIONS -->
  <section class="section-y">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">Where we work</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-2 text-fg mb-6">
          Based in India,<br/>
          <span class="text-gradient-light">working globally</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-fg-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Our team is based in Coimbatore, India. Our clients are in the US, UK, UAE, and India.
          We work async-first — your morning is our evening, and the work happens while you
          sleep. Fresh insights in your inbox every morning.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        {[
          { city: 'Coimbatore', country: 'India', role: 'HQ' },
          { city: 'London', country: 'UK', role: 'European clients' },
          { city: 'Dubai', country: 'UAE', role: 'Middle East clients' },
          { city: 'New York', country: 'USA', role: 'Americas clients' },
        ].map((l) => (
          <div class="card p-6 text-center">
            <i class="ph-bold ph-map-pin text-[var(--color-brand)] text-2xl mb-3"></i>
            <div class="font-bold text-fg">{l.city}</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-fg-muted mono uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">{l.country}</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-fg-muted">{l.role}</div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section-y relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="orb-red top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2"></div>
    <div class="container-wide relative text-center">
      <h2 class="text-display-2 text-fg mb-6">
        Let's see<br/>
        <span class="text-gradient-brand">where you stand</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-fg-secondary mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Free PULSE audit. 90 seconds. Real numbers.
      </p>
      <a href="/pulse-audit" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">
        <i class="ph-bold ph-lightning"></i>
        Get my free PULSE audit
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
